<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>(주)월드피스 | 종합 경호·보안 & 행사안전 전문기업</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="(주)월드피스는 충북지방경찰청 정식 허가를 받은 종합 경호·보안 전문기업으로, 신변보호·시설경비·행사안전관리와 행사 기획·운영, 영상·미디어 제작까지 원스톱 솔루션을 제공합니다.">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #111827;
      background: #0b1220;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    header {
      padding: 24px 8vw;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(15,23,42,0.98), rgba(30,64,175,0.75));
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      z-index: 20;
    }
    .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }
    .logo span {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }
    .nav-small {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9ca3af;
    }
    main {
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }
    .hero {
      padding: 72px 8vw 64px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding-top: 40px;
      }
    }
    .hero-kicker {
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #93c5fd;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero-title span {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #d1d5db;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.7);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.4);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #bfdbfe;
    }
    .hero-badge-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #22c55e;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(34,197,94,0.8);
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .btn-primary, .btn-ghost {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.18s ease-out;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #2563eb, #38bdf8);
      border-color: rgba(191,219,254,0.3);
      color: #f9fafb;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(37,99,235,0.45);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(37,99,235,0.6);
    }
    .btn-ghost {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.7);
      border-color: rgba(148,163,184,0.5);
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
    }
    .hero-meta {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9ca3af;
    }
    .hero-meta span {
      color: #e5e7eb;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .hero-card {
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 22px 22px 18px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(37,99,235,0.35), transparent 55%),
                  linear-gradient(to bottom right, #020617, #020617, #020617);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
    }
    .hero-card-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero-card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .pill {
      padding: 10px 10px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(55,65,81,0.8);
    }
    .pill-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }
    .pill-value {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }
    .pill-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(22,163,74,0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.6);
      color: #bbf7d0;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 40px 8vw 32px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .section-sub {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .grid-3 {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
    .card {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.95);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px 16px 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55,65,81,0.9);
    }
    .card-kicker {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #60a5fa;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .card-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .card-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #d1d5db;
    }

    .contact-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .contact-box {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
    .contact-panel {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(59,130,246,0.3), transparent 55%),
                  rgba(15,23,42,0.96);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 20px 18px 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.6);
    }
    .contact-line {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .contact-label {
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 80px;
      color: #9ca3af;
    }
    footer {
      padding: 18px 8vw 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(31,41,55,1);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #6b7280;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">
      WORLD<span>PEACE</span> GUARD
    </div>
    <div class="nav-small">
      종합 경호·보안 · 행사안전 · 영상·미디어
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-kicker">INFINITE SAFETY SERVICE</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
